<title>FRANCE: Rhone-Poulenc nine-month result detailed.</title>
<headline>Rhone-Poulenc nine-month result detailed.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are nine-months totals for Rhone-Poulenc results:</p>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net sales				   63,749  vs	  63,121</p>
<p>    Operating				    5,688  vs	   5,779</p>
<p>    Equity in net earnings of affiliates   744  vs	     326</p>
<p>    Net interest expenses		    1,690  vs	   1,161</p>
<p>    Pre-tax income			     5,029  vs	   5,024</p>
<p>    Taxes					  1,550  vs	   1,583</p>
<p>    Minority interests			   459  vs	     624</p>
<p>    Preferred remunerations		    854  vs	     857</p>
<p>    Net income (incl Albumin 81 million chge)2,166  vs	   1,960</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (francs)	     6.69  vs	    6.19</p>
<p>Note -- The firm said nine-month operating income and sales for the 1995 comparative period were 4,785 million francs and 62,541 million francs when restated on the basis of 1996 structure.</p>
</text>
